From: Realme GT2 Pro development
Subject: [PATCH] sm8450-common: select the existing AOSP AIDL multihal service

Apply after 0001 for ROM candidates. The pinned tree provides the generic
service, its init rc and AIDL-v3 VINTF fragment. The configured dynamic/QTI/Oplus
sub-HALs expose the multihal interfaces consumed by its HalProxy adapter.
This closes a source-selection omission; runtime sensor behavior remains untested.

--- a/common.mk
+++ b/common.mk
@@ -245,6 +245,7 @@
 
 # Sensors
 PRODUCT_PACKAGES += \
+    android.hardware.sensors-service.multihal \
     sensors.dynamic_sensor_hal \
     sensors.oplus
 
